OL,3,GNEWSAFormer nurse dies amid dementia
OL,4,Adrug shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former nurse died weeks after her
OL,7,Ffamily was unable to get her regular
OL,8,Fmedication for dementia, amid national
OL,9,Fsupply problems.
OL,11,FPearl Roche's family said they wanted
OL,12,Fto speak out because she spent her life
OL,13,Fcaring for others, and would never want
OL,14,Fto see anyone else suffer.
OL,16,FHer medication, Galantamine, is used to
OL,17,Ftreat mild to moderate memory loss and
OL,18,Fmental changes linked to Alzheimer's
OL,19,Fdisease. While not a cure, her family
OL,20,Fbelieve it improved her quality of
OL,21,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
